The '''Western Zone''', also known as the '''western agrizone''', was an area on the [[planet]] [[Lothal]] that contained [[LothalNet comm tower E-272]], located in grid Q6, which fell into disuse after the area was seized by the [[Galactic Empire]].<ref name="Rebel Journal by Ezra Bridger" />

